-- 1. Create schema in new database
-- 2. Migrate owned tables from monolith
-- 3. Set up replication for read-only data
-- 4. Update application connection strings
-- 5. Verify data integrity
-- 6. Cut over traffic
--
-- Rollback:
-- 1. Revert connection strings
-- 2. Sync any new data back to monolith
-- 3. Drop microservice schema
-- ============================================================================

